## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Proc Set Timer|r 0.2.1
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Shows when a set's proc fires, how long it stays active and how long its cooldown has left -- for every set you wear whose bonus text names a time. Nothing about any set is stored in the add-on: the worn sets, durations and cooldowns are read from the game's own item and bonus text in your game language, so a balance patch or a new set needs no update.
## Version: 0.2.1
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsProcSetTimer_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Parse.lua
Settings.lua

